<title>NETHERLANDS: Schuttersveld buys German firm.</title>
<headline>Schuttersveld buys German firm.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch industrial and services group Schuttersveld Holding Nv said on Wednesday it had agreed to buy Germany's Binder Magnete.</p>
<p>The takeover will contribute to Schutterveld earnings per share, it said.  </p>
<p>Binder has annual turnover of about 115 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
